---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const pageTitle = "Welcome to the New Knit It Now";
const description =
  "Thank you for joining the early preview of the new Knit It Now. Explore, poke around, and share honest feedback as you go.";

const startLinks = [
  {
    title: "Try an Interactive Pattern",
    href: "/patterns",
  },
  {
    title: "Browse the Help Hub",
    href: "/help-hub/",
  },
];
---

<Layout
  title={`${pageTitle} | Knit it Now`}
  {description}
  bodyClass="page--tight-header"
>
  <article class="beta-welcome-page page-wrap" aria-label="Beta welcome">
    <h1>{pageTitle}</h1>

    <div class="beta-welcome-page__hero">
      <div class="beta-welcome-page__intro-lead">
        <p>
          Thank you for joining this <strong>early preview</strong> of the new Knit It Now. </p><p>I’ve been rebuilding the
          platform to make the website <strong>more helpful, interactive, and easier to use</strong>.</p> <p>I'd love for you to explore and share your thoughts.</p>
        </p>
      </div>

      <figure class="beta-welcome-page__photo">
        <img
          src="/images/knit-by-machine-sue.png"
          alt="Sue at her knitting machine"
          width="1385"
          height="1371"
          loading="eager"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </figure>
    </div>

    <div class="beta-welcome-page__intro">
      <p>You’ll notice a few things are different here:</p>

      <ul class="beta-welcome-page__list">
        <li>interactive patterns</li>
        <li>built-in help</li>
        <li>videos and quick tips</li>
        <li>easier-to-follow instructions</li>
        <li>tools to support you while you knit</li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        This is still a work in progress—and that’s why you’re here. I’m not looking for formal
        testers or polished reports. I want to know what real knitters think as they use the site.
      </p>

      <p>
        If something feels confusing, helpful, frustrating, or easier than before, tell me. Even
        short notes help—a lot:
      </p>

      <ul class="beta-welcome-page__list beta-welcome-page__list--examples">
        <li>“This part was really clear.”</li>
        <li>“I got lost here.”</li>
        <li>“I wish this worked differently.”</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <section class="beta-welcome-page__section" aria-labelledby="beta-welcome-starts-heading">
      <h2 id="beta-welcome-starts-heading">A Few Good Places to Start</h2>

      <ul class="beta-welcome-page__starts">
        {
          startLinks.map((link) => (
            <li>
              <a class="kbm-btn kbm-btn-outline beta-welcome-page__start-btn" href={link.href}>
                {link.title}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="beta-welcome-page__section" aria-labelledby="beta-welcome-note-heading">
      <h2 id="beta-welcome-note-heading">One Important Note</h2>

      <div class="beta-welcome-page__callout">
        <p>
          This is a new platform, so your old Knit It Now login does not transfer. You’ve created
          your new access account—please use this login from here on.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="beta-welcome-page__section" aria-labelledby="beta-welcome-most-heading">
      <h2 id="beta-welcome-most-heading">Most of All…</h2>

      <p>
        No need to “do testing.” Just poke around—explore, try a pattern, open help cards—and tell
        me what you’re thinking.
      </p>

      <p>Thank you for being part of this next chapter of Knit It Now.</p>

      <img
        class="beta-welcome-page__signature"
        src="/images/sue-signature.svg"
        alt="Sue"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </section>

    <div class="beta-welcome-page__feedback">
      <a
        href="#"
        class="kbm-btn kbm-btn-primary contact-modal-trigger"
        data-contact-source="beta-welcome"
      >
        Send Sue Feedback
      </a>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .beta-welcome-page.page-wrap {
    /* Layout main already clears the fixed header */
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .beta-welcome-page {
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .beta-welcome-page h1 {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.15rem);
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: var(--kbm-green, #52682d);
  }

  .beta-welcome-page__hero {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: start;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .beta-welcome-page__photo {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 320px;
    justify-self: center;
  }

  .beta-welcome-page__photo img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 14px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(82, 104, 45, 0.12);
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .beta-welcome-page__photo {
      order: -1;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .beta-welcome-page__hero {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) min(280px, 38%);
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .beta-welcome-page__photo {
      max-width: none;
      justify-self: end;
    }
  }

  .beta-welcome-page h2 {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 1.5rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--kbm-green, #52682d);
  }

  .beta-welcome-page__intro-lead p,
  .beta-welcome-page__intro p,
  .beta-welcome-page__section p {
    margin: 40 0 1rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: #374151;
  }

  .beta-welcome-page__list {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    padding-left: 100px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: #374151;
  }

  .beta-welcome-page__list li + li {
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
  }

  .beta-welcome-page__list--examples {
    list-style: none;
    padding-left: 30;
  }

  .beta-welcome-page__list--examples li {
    padding-left: 0;
  }

  .beta-welcome-page__section {
    margin-top: 2.25rem;
  }

  .beta-welcome-page__starts {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .beta-welcome-page__starts li {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .beta-welcome-page__start-btn {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: center;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .beta-welcome-page__callout {
    padding: 1.1rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: #f3f6ef;
    border: 1px solid rgba(82, 104, 45, 0.15);
  }

  .beta-welcome-page__callout p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: #374151;
  }

  .beta-welcome-page__signature {
    display: block;
    width: auto;
    height: auto;
    max-width: clamp(96px, 22vw, 132px);
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .beta-welcome-page__feedback {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .beta-welcome-page__feedback .kbm-btn {
    min-width: min(100%, 280px);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .beta-welcome-page__starts {
      flex-direction: row;
      flex-wrap: nowrap;
      gap: 1rem;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .beta-welcome-page__starts li {
      flex: 1 1 0;
    }

    .beta-welcome-page__start-btn {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      height: 100%;
      min-height: 3rem;
      padding-left: 0.85rem;
      padding-right: 0.85rem;
    }
  }
</style>
